// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO4/18/19/23 (microSD SPI bus), GPIO21/22
// (internal IMU+PMU I2C), GPIO25 (speaker/DAC), GPIO34 (mic), GPIO16/17
// (internally wired to PSRAM on this WROVER module) - confirmed via
// M5Stack Fire docs.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO15 tagged "led_neopixel" - confirmed docs.m5stack.com/en/core/fire
// (onboard 10x SK6812 RGB LED bar, single data pin GPIO15).
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO37/38/39 tagged "button" - confirmed docs.m5stack.com/en/core/fire
// (physical Button C/B/A, plain GPIO inputs, unlike Core2/CoreS3 capacitive touch).
{
  "boardName": "ESP32",
